cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "RAG Techniques: A Community-Driven Collection of Retrieval-Augmented Generation Methods"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2024-07-13"
authors:
  - family-names: "Diamant"
    given-names: "Nir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/RAG_Techniques"
url: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/RAG_Techniques"
abstract: >-
  A community-driven collection of 41 runnable Jupyter notebooks teaching
  Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), from foundational retrieval and
  chunking through adaptive, agentic, graph-based and self-correcting
  systems, with an accompanying evaluation suite. Each notebook covers the
  intuition behind one technique, a full implementation, and the source it
  derives from.
keywords:
  - rag
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - llm
  - embeddings
  - vector-database
  - semantic-search
  - agentic-rag
  - graph-rag
  - generative-ai
  - tutorials
